# "If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn": a creature none of Anger of the Gods's damage was dealt to is not
# covered (CR 615.1). Bot2 answers with Healing Salve on its Ornithopter, preventing all 3, so the Ornithopter was not dealt
# damage this way; when Lightning Bolt then kills it, it goes to the graveyard. Bot1's own Ornithopter was dealt damage and is
# exiled - the contrast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Anger of the Gods
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Healing Salve
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Anger of the Gods.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot2.Modes(Prevent the next 3 damage)
Bot2.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Healing Salve
Exile = Ornithopter
